{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["העיני האנשים ההם תנקר — Do you suppose that those men who grumble against you have no eyes to see this stumbling block — that from the land of Egypt, a good land, you brought us up to die in the wilderness, for you did not fulfill your stipulation to bring us into a land flowing with milk and honey, but instead these forty years they will die in the wilderness?" "לא נעלה — Therefore we will not go up to you. General statement and specification, and he returned to the general: first he said לא נעלה, then he specified why, and returned to the general: therefore — we will not go up."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:20.986423703Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}